      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we distinguish an absent FRU from a failed EEPROM collection before attempting fallback? parseVpdFile() returns an empty variant when the presence GPIO reports the FRU absent and explicitly treats that as a non-failure. With no redundant EEPROM configured, this path now logs a predictive EEPROM PEL and marks collection Failed, whereas the previous flow handled the empty result as completed.",
